@@ -2,6 +2,17 @@

 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Access
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>` on every request. Viewers can use GET
+routes except the audit log. Cooks can also POST recipe cooks, batch waste,
+temperatures and stock-take counts. Managers can use every route.
+
+`GET /audit` returns a manager the successful writes newest first. Each
+entry contains `time`, `keyName`, `method`, `path` and `status`.
+Missing or invalid credentials return 401 (`unauthorized`). Insufficient
+permissions return 403 (`forbidden`).
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
